main(arguments)
    Dispatch existing interactive, serving and application-directory commands.
    For script FILE, run one executable file and return its exit status.
    For test FILES, run the independent-file suite and return aggregate status.

coordinator command(arguments)
    Parse existing coordinator options and optional script file.
    Reject script combined with expression evaluation or interactive REPL.
    Validate script, add its containing directory to class lookup, and select
    strict one-shot script mode.

Internal object --snapshot supplies a native clone bootstrap file; ordinary starts are unchanged.

Shell startup searches user paths, current directory and normal bundled classes before legacy shell example fallbacks. Pass the same ordered paths to child object processes.
